# Root-level Lightroom sidecars are private by default. These four reviewed,
# owner-authored project presets are explicit source fixtures.
*.[Xx][Mm][Pp]
!/niho-priset_colorful.xmp
!/niho-preset bluesky2.xmp
!/niho-preset night.xmp
!/niho-preset pastel.xmp

# Future local catalog stores. Checked-in schema files belong under Sources or
# a dedicated migrations directory, never as a live database at repo root.
